1. PRODUCT IDENTITY
==================================================

Product: ClipForge AI

Tagline: Turn Long Videos Into Powerful Short Stories.

Product Category: Autonomous AI Video Repurposing Agent.

Problem:

Content creators, educators, podcasters, businesses, and video creators spend considerable time watching long videos, finding meaningful moments, cutting clips, resizing videos, and creating subtitles.

Solution:

ClipForge AI automatically understands long-form video content, identifies the most useful and engaging moments, and converts them into editable, ready-to-export vertical short videos.

Core promise:

Upload one long video → AI understands it → finds the best moments → generates multiple short clips → adds subtitles → lets users edit and export.

This is a human-in-the-loop AI agent. Users must review the generated clips before final export.

Do not claim guaranteed virality or automatic audience growth.

