8. EXPLAINABLE HIGHLIGHT SCORING
==================================================

Create a transparent scoring engine.

Use this weighted scoring model:

- Completeness: 30%
- Hook strength: 25%
- Useful information: 20%
- Emotional or expressive emphasis: 15%
- Duration fit: 10%

Calculate an overall score between 0 and 100.

Show the score breakdown.

For every clip, explain why it was selected.

IMPORTANT:

The score represents the quality of the candidate according to our selection criteria.

It is NOT a prediction of viral performance, views, likes, or engagement.

