9. AI CLIP GENERATION ENGINE
==================================================

This is the most important functionality.

The application must convert selected timestamp ranges from the ORIGINAL uploaded video into actual playable MP4 clips.

Do not create fake video previews.

Use FFmpeg or a verified alternative.

Requirements:

- Accurate start time.
- Accurate end time.
- Preserve audio.
- Preserve source content.
- H.264 video encoding.
- AAC audio encoding.
- MP4 output.

Generate vertical 9:16 videos.

Recommended export resolution:
1080 × 1920.

Use 720 × 1280 as a faster fallback.

For the first implementation, use center crop.

Optional advanced layout:
- Blurred background fill.
- Original video centered.
- Maintain natural proportions.

Avoid stretching or distorting the video.

Create a separate rendering process for each selected candidate.

Allow users to choose which candidates to render.

Limit simultaneous rendering to avoid exhausting memory.

